cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Bosch Smart System — verified BLE field map"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "redundo.app"
    website: "https://redundo.app"
abstract: >-
  Ground-truth-verified reverse-engineering of the Bosch Smart System eBike
  Bluetooth LE interface: the diagnostic telemetry channel (0x0011), the
  official Live Data Interface (eb21), field scalings, frame format, the
  stored-log transport, and capture method. Verified on a BDU3740 /
  Performance Line CX.
